    why_llmsTxt: `llms.txt is a small text file in the root of the website (e.g. example.com/llms.txt). It describes the website in a few sentences and lists the most important pages, so language models get an overview quickly. The format is a proposal from 2024, not a standard. To be honest: whether the large AI providers use the file today is not proven. The effort is small; the benefit is still open.`,
